 239  *Load parameters and input data from the GDX file into the model
--- LOAD  s = 2:s
--- LOAD  j = 5:j
--- LOAD  dem = 7:dem
--- LOAD  v = 10:v
--- LOAD  t = 1:t
--- LOAD  y = 3:y
--- LOAD  n = 4:n
--- LOAD  LinkID = 13:LinkID
