 304  *Set min vegetation removal to zero (could not load from GDX) - DER 9/25/2018
 305  minrv(j,k,t,n) = 0;
 306   
 307  * Display the input data values in the listing file. Go through these values to Check if the GDXXRW function reads and loads the parameters correctly into the model
 308  Display s,j,dem, InitC, InitD, InitStor,b, wght ;
